{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "72d2cbfa-ee66-85e4-a712-07a43a4303aa",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T10:21:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, honey. Good morning. I hope I'm not catching you at a bad time. I'm calling about a puddle, if you can believe it. Well, it's more than a puddle, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six Marsh Street, down the Point. It's right out front, in the road. It goes across about half the street, and it just sits there. Every day I walk by, same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has it been raining a lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what gets me, dear. No. It hasn't rained properly in, oh, the better part of a month. So it's not from weather. Something's not draining, and I'm tired of looking at it, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it right at a storm drain, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate right at the edge of it, yes. The water just sits over it like it's plugged. I can see leaves down in there, and it's a little greenish at the edges now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So a catch basin that's not taking water, dry weather, half the lane covered. Any smell, or is it clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little musty, not terrible. My neighbor two doors down, she runs a tiny bakery out of her kitchen, and she says customers have to step right around it to get to her door. She's not happy either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet. Is the water deep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep enough that a little kid could splash right in. And you know, we're close to the water down here, and people walk their dogs along this stretch all day. Kids go by on their way to the shore. I just worry somebody's going to slip, or the dog gets in it. Who knows what's in that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check the drain and clear it. Marsh Street, number six, The Point. Can I have a name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Adriana Salazar. S-A-L-A-Z-A-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Salazar. And a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0189. And I'd like a call back when it's done, if you could, so I know it's been taken care of. I don't want to keep phoning and bothering you people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother. I'll note it on the order that you want a call once it's cleared. Probably the next few days, since the holiday week has things a little slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, dear. I just want it gone before it freezes over. That'd be a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good point, I'll mention that too. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you, Denise. You have a nice rest of your Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T10:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
